{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "cf44d9527a0baa410cc3ab42c09ad293b39b1d270334c2d876521f40682741f0", "ja": "寄り添いの結果", "zh": "相伴相随的结果", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ad6227d3539d8dce3c12a53c04b81c38c88e842f21ea076a6c33392cde75b63a", "ja": "撮影本番が始まり、練習の時以上に気合いの\n入った演技を見せるアイドル達。そんな中、\n台本では悲壮なシーンが熱くなる結果に。\nリテイクになると思われたが、監督が協議し\nそのパターンも残すことになる。", "zh": "拍摄正式开始，偶像们展现出了比练习时更加投入的演技。就在这时，剧本中的悲壮场面却变得更加激烈。原本以为要重拍，但导演经过讨论后，决定保留这一版本。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "aa488fced9ab02e5bc09468679c80391248b8cb72925d9bd97cabac5652b0c3c", "ja": "（今日からついに撮影本番が始まる。\nみんな、気合い十分だ！）", "zh": "（今天终于要正式开始拍摄了。大家都干劲十足！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6c79effbdccb85a5f7b7a71b816e2aac897f80c9620a78f9598f76ab2d8324db", "ja": "はーい！　生き残りゲームの配信者として、思いっきり\n煽っちゃいますから、みんな覚悟しててくださいね♪", "zh": "好——！作为生存游戏的主播，我会尽情煽动气氛的，大家可要做好心理准备哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d31198208c7ee814e3251f5adff266e1ee8e56e70738aeb79d2b9d763e7ff1ae", "ja": "ねっ、星梨花ちゃん！", "zh": "对吧，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "6e5ec6a6e21612b0ce282daf0e87b27e22d4ed24258e89ff9e077075d1f1b9a4", "ja": "はい！　わたしも、富豪の鞠音として……\nわたしなりに、精いっぱいがんばります！", "zh": "好的！我也会作为富豪鞠音……\n以自己的方式竭尽全力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "b6b708b32b8bd811fc9b07d861f3df030bd126522b433ab013582b52879ad121", "ja": "今回のドラマをアチーブメントするには、\nロコたち全員が、フルコミットしないとですよね！", "zh": "要完成这次的剧情，ROCO大家必须全力以赴才行呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "e346430972fbb892d4f913fb22b635a0773e0f45e516ccd4e57292949bf68574", "ja": "アユム、レイカ、がんばりましょうね♪", "zh": "步、丽花，一起加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "127591c4ef1925d238bcc061f41fecd35d071ac4c881714d61b577fb0c5d976a", "ja": "もちろん！　ここまでやってきたんだ、\n悔いの残らないよう、全部出しきらないとね♪", "zh": "当然啦！都努力走到这一步了，\n可得把所有本事都拿出来，不留任何遗憾才行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "8d4581219e53cc0027730b5d5040d8b0155e171bd7a598885ee9a0cddaea393b", "ja": "はいはーい！　私も、チトセくんらしいお芝居が\nできるように、がんばりますね♪", "zh": "好啦好啦！我也会努力演出符合千岁风格的戏哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f8e6efa341e592d586c44843a567977aebbb3ea949a207e9e0a73409f2f25eb8", "ja": "あはっ！　ここまでよく生き残ってきたけど、\nここで命運尽きちゃったってカンジだね～☆", "zh": "啊哈！亏你能坚持活到现在，\n不过看来你的好运也到此为止了呢～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "dc03b828c2ce5f880019b045eeff17393cfd7e8a94052cbbf9d74fcb1ff5fa0b", "ja": "どうですか？　リタイアしますか？\n今なら特別に、命だけは助けてあげてもいいよ？", "zh": "怎么样？要不要认输？\n现在投降的话，我可以特别开恩，饶你一命哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1010_025roc", "source_sha256": "6bc151d45c65127988f6af009e5e798200eaccf5dd6780d0fd34cf3251f86794", "ja": "な、なあ……降参しようよ！\nそしたらみんな、命だけは助かるんじゃ……。", "zh": "那、那个……我们投降吧！\n这样的话，大家至少能保住性命吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "93776245400ed095b2f2c65212de466adce1975ac514f5137f57740e1d3fbc36", "ja": "あんなヤツ信じられるわけないだろ！　忘れたのか？\nヤツがこれまでこのゲームで、何をしてきたか……。", "zh": "怎么可能信得过那种家伙啊！你忘了吗？\n那家伙至今为止在这场游戏里，都干了些什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "c175b5a91e0f826c9462e0bb9111d86306d1994f1071230d3d2ae6fae030e93f", "ja": "何もかも、ゲームの一環って考えているような\n悪趣味なヤツさ。当然、これもウソに決まってる！", "zh": "那家伙好像把一切都当成游戏的一部分，真是个趣味恶劣的家伙。当然，这肯定也是骗人的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e661aa40cbd784234af885baa5b87b3c4b274f4de2a74691f8e8fabc51bb7d27", "ja": "そんなコトないよ～？　ちゃんと、生きてる\n人達だっているんだから……ほらっ☆", "zh": "没那回事啦～？也有些人是真心活着的……你看☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "66126f39c4d9d5d29a40217090411e8d2be019e381b24f8548706aed8cac8c7b", "ja": "くそっ、いい加減ここから出せよ！　なんで\nこんなところに閉じ込められなきゃならないんだ！", "zh": "可恶，赶紧把我放出去！为什么非得把我关在这种地方不可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "a2d66a5a1441d6a76a000b76872193c29637613ce0d6afd977bc19c5090e6a37", "ja": "私たちは負けたんだから、家に帰してよ！\nねえ！", "zh": "我们已经输了，让我们回家嘛！\n喂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "234848a7ea3cb2ff33db9fa2ba0b96c4b9bc05b51068626406edbc8f0384d7c1", "ja": "でもぉ、「負けたら家に帰す」……なんて、\n契約書には書いてないからな～。", "zh": "可是，“输了就让你回家”……这种事，合同里可没写啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "b949f37dfa8795a8096f5ea4d1dbafe4672922fd6a5386d7eedb83aa9b0e351e", "ja": "な、なんだって！？\nそんな条件、どこにも……あっ！", "zh": "什、什么！？\n这种条件，哪里都没写……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "710de6fccf99696151bc700d2f21adcea475309ad2fa0522a2dce5c5d859bf4a", "ja": "ウソ……どうして？\nこんな文言、契約書にはなかったはず……！", "zh": "骗人的……为什么？\n合同里明明没有这样的条款才对……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1019_016tsu", "source_sha256": "23539b8505d511832d2717942c904ee08683deaa2cf1e992a8ba1adfe6d94170", "ja": "ん～、どうしようかな～。\nね、鞠音様。どうします？", "zh": "嗯～该怎么办呢～。\n对吧，鞠音大人。要怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "b1f7c8bd22c46ba5b40accd84a72c939337e024c38df6c39c050c33ec4c570d3", "ja": "そのとおりだ。貴様らはこのゲームに参加した時点で、\n勝利して、莫大な賞金を手にするか……。", "zh": "正是如此。你们从参加这个游戏的那一刻起，就只有两条路可走：获胜，拿到巨额奖金……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "0d990882dfcbd364eefccc3f086fd96c1d646f27b70a7924327839df8b2f8130", "ja": "負けて、私達の人形になるか……\nそのどちらかしかないのだ。", "zh": "要么输掉，成为我们的玩偶……只有这两种选择。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ecbba44f1ef476ff252e64ea5a72993fc973346de95ffcc8e624c025b163fc2c", "ja": "そういうコト☆　これはこの世で最強最高の\nエンタメなんだから、体を張ってくれなきゃ！　ね？", "zh": "就是这样☆ 这可是世上最强最棒的娱乐，当然得豁出去才行！对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3dae4c8e6ea9865606d10de7e598cb53f7653dd09ef2f5ff18f6d3794824c926", "ja": "最強最高、ね。\n最悪、を忘れてんじゃないのか？", "zh": "最强最高，是吧。\n你是不是忘了\"最糟糕\"这回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1024_025roc", "source_sha256": "df116b491f689b3ac9d9d2a748245d2d90448506398af4981e7cb5ea2b4e3165", "ja": "なんだよ……。それじゃ、勝っても負けても、\n俺たちみんな殺されるってコト……？", "zh": "搞什么啊……也就是说，不管赢了还是输了，我们都会被杀掉……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "4725b965325e247d4f359f12cdd34277f9c0d59ee8356de9c7571524e74902a0", "ja": "……諦めが早いんだな、カナエ。\nお前が夢を諦めたのも、そんなに早かったのか？", "zh": "……你放弃得还真快啊，奏惠。\n你当年放弃梦想的时候，也是这么快的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1026_025roc", "source_sha256": "9ec2a40c32fd943abf4402d674a46ead0006900993bd5209fbd6ae5cdd07ef6e", "ja": "はぁ！！？\nい、今その話は関係ないだろ！？", "zh": "哈啊！！？\n现、现在说那个干什么，跟这件事又没关系吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "b9f3be09ae54797d9ff87cd147100350fd4ca3a77485bf42cac2579a7fdd4f77", "ja": "いいや、関係ある。", "zh": "不，有关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "384a4a7581713b2f6f80cb3e77b498aa09ca61a01fcfca402b14e4960671b736", "ja": "お前、本当にその程度の覚悟でここまで来たのか？\n違うだろ。絶対、人生を変えてやるって言ってただろ。", "zh": "你真的就抱着这种程度的觉悟走到这里来的吗？\n不是吧。你明明说过，绝对要改变自己的人生的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "ebbf928b3b706474282cfd608fae86615867867aa275db7e9f89224c45015d5c", "ja": "僕は諦めない。勝利も、金も……何もかも、全部だ。\nこのふざけたゲームに勝って、全部手に入れてやる！", "zh": "我不会放弃。胜利、金钱……什么都要，全部都要。\n我要赢下这场荒唐的游戏，把一切都拿到手！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1031_025roc", "source_sha256": "d3c71c83640c9d65b1ee1dceb2b7c73e3e50f6c34b4453c0ed42b163487e3a3b", "ja": "人がせっかく心配してやってんのに……！\nもう、どうなったって知らないからな！？", "zh": "我好不容易替你们担心了一场……！\n以后你们爱怎么样就怎么样，我可不管了啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1032_025roc", "source_sha256": "04e03a7a9273a35825871edf7768447a9024db950b6003bdd587079dfd081802", "ja": "アンタらのことは嫌いじゃないけど……いざって時は、\n俺ひとりでも生き残ってやるから！　そのつもりで！", "zh": "我也不是讨厌你们……但真到了关键时刻，\n我一个人也要活下来！你们就做好这个心理准备吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1033_048rei", "source_sha256": "a93c03d00f96b424c5802d072c7b0fde0a06cd59babbbc732c203454473836f9", "ja": "僕たちは全員、最初からそのつもりだろ。\n今さらだ。", "zh": "我们所有人从一开始就是这么打算的吧。现在才说这些，晚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7e9405c40136fbfb4145f5c3d0b3b6294c95e0e5c00a97578d48ba164e5cc34c", "ja": "あっはっは！　良く言ったぜチトセ。　\nそう来なくっちゃな！　面白くなってきやがった。", "zh": "啊哈哈！说得好啊，千岁。\n就得这样才对嘛！事情变得越来越有意思了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1035_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8e44a52031b5a62694f8655e5a43848517670b847629c96ed19a4a000fe931b3", "ja": "お前さんにギャンブルに手を出さないほうがいいって\n言ったが、ありゃ前言撤回だ。勝負師向いてるぜ。", "zh": "我之前还劝过你别碰赌博来着，不过那话我收回。你很有当赌徒的天分。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "8a16478db9e809fa1a36cfa755d735d6120f7e8d8c7e6a09c8f511d182b25b7f", "ja": "は？　何言って……。", "zh": "啊？你在说什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1037_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ceac98b3a041509f02ca9d4f775227120eb6e4b7321e675ec640a5f684a5be9e", "ja": "どっちが勝ってもおかしくない勝負ってのは、最後は\n空気とか気持ちとか、そんなモンが味方になるのさ。", "zh": "在这种谁赢都不奇怪的较量中，最后能成为助力的，往往是气氛啊、心情啊之类的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5abd35e6ab6a59828074c9458a285b03fc2bfa84820b43c241fead55c035a9bc", "ja": "お前が発破をかけたことで、空気が変わった。あのまま\n弱気を引きずられちゃ、勝てるモンも勝てないからな。", "zh": "因为你这么一激，气氛变了。要是就那样一直被怯懦的情绪拖着走，明明能赢的比赛也赢不了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1039_048rei", "source_sha256": "1e095364519034a32cdde1c599ef9bc825b0ecf2c94894280b73defca17612db", "ja": "別に、そんなつもりはない。\n僕はただ、思ったことを言っただけで……。", "zh": "没别的意思。  \n我只是把想到的说出来而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1040_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9d0aef5c923b0ea794af86e128894dcafb7fc458366c36baf7857448b9e8350c", "ja": "それもいいんだよ。ウソがなくてな。\nウソを生き抜くには、ひとつ真実が必要、ってな！", "zh": "这样也很好啊。因为没有撒谎嘛。要想在谎言中活下去，就需要一个真相，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1041_kantoku", "source_sha256": "716dd91c21bbe284a7283424a14b944e2d4047e0436c7ced1a2ccd3d82a6ed47", "ja": "カーット！\n……。", "zh": "卡——！\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1042_p", "source_sha256": "9b6e3852e390b7ae6a387572548eab206b0c30f598d86cd5212696cf90417ea3", "ja": "（台本の印象より、かなり熱いシーンだった。本来は、\nもう少し悲壮なムードが漂う印象だったけど……）", "zh": "（这是比剧本给人的印象要热烈得多的场景。本来给人的感觉，应该是更加悲壮的氛围才对……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1043_p", "source_sha256": "c5b39788562c2248db6890d343909e950961c8cffe9e694ceff3d2a7189b13fb", "ja": "（これは、リテイクになるかな。でも……\n麗花達の演技は、今までで一番……）", "zh": "（这会要重拍吗？不过……丽花她们的演技，是至今为止最……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1044_022ser", "source_sha256": "bbde7a308255e8dc3e15d34be28782c295acf69234c3b4d9230f21a32a9b659e", "ja": "撮影、なかなか再開されませんね。スタッフさんたちが\n集まって話しているみたいですけど……。", "zh": "拍摄一直没能重新开始呢。工作人员好像聚在一起商量什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1045_025roc", "source_sha256": "589ae075fd87673d51ea50c650b960f61a89cae0a7d7d96574a4304deef572c5", "ja": "何かアクシデントでもあったんでしょうか？", "zh": "是不是发生什么意外了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1046_jokantoku", "source_sha256": "a60c75f304dfd165304750f9b7b859f1784ad43851774eb44939d5e0132dd0cc", "ja": "すみません！　キャストの皆さん、\n集まってもらってもいいですか？", "zh": "不好意思！各位演员，可以请大家集合吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1047_kantoku", "source_sha256": "5200901fa14460b1cfbda8d9c88953d7d7b539f5c5feb95514d6e75ecf6fc620", "ja": "先程のシーンですが、全体的に想定より熱い流れに\nなっていて、いったんリテイクになります。", "zh": "刚才的场景整体发展得比预想中更热烈，需要先重拍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1048_kantoku", "source_sha256": "fddf5570db6da088f80b29c59720438833ceb8b37c1377132b2ea3e0c5fc513f", "ja": "しかし、あの熱量を持ったチトセから新鮮な魅力を\n感じたのも確かで……スタッフ間で相談していました。", "zh": "不过，我们确实也从那位热情洋溢的千岁身上感受到了新鲜的魅力……工作人员之间一直在商量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1049_kantoku", "source_sha256": "36a6267531f1147fe9e355b667d69c8284715ff0ed4f7a9e792a3a9fe0fdc340", "ja": "念のため後のシーンも、あのパターンで撮って\nおきたいという話が出てるんですが……どうでしょう？", "zh": "有人提议说，以防万一后面的场景也按那个\n模式拍一份备用……您觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1050_048rei", "source_sha256": "dbe5486996b0d811b1b585da3fbd0f40e98be304bad5a576e4f2bb51ea1102b8", "ja": "本当ですか！？　わーいわーい！\nよろしくお願いしますね！", "zh": "真的吗！？太好了太好了！\n那就拜托您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1051_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8bdc690c673e589d1ca3d8cf683fef9ce129a07a5644aff3a86ec35a2b84bb46", "ja": "今日の麗花さん、気合い入ってるな～って思ったけど。\nわたしも、あっちのチトセの方が好きかも。", "zh": "我本来还觉得今天的丽花姐特别有干劲呢～不过，我可能也更喜欢那边的千岁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1052_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4ea88b2b78772c8b3f0230fc1eff78034a1fa87d8796b7907dd65f45df8a23c4", "ja": "チトセが熱い感じでいくなら、リイチやカナエたちの\nセリフや芝居も、すこし変わってくるからね。", "zh": "如果千岁要走热血路线，理一、加奈惠他们的台词和表演也会稍微有所变化呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1053_025roc", "source_sha256": "f855718440c2a4441264ffb8d8d4c88363843eb3d5ef4eceff5937d3be7705d7", "ja": "ロコたちもアジャストメントが必要そうですね。\nいろいろ考えながら、やってみましょう！", "zh": "看来ROCO他们也需要做些调整呢。\n我们一边思考各种可能，一边试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1054_048rei", "source_sha256": "0f23b14ffcb55a49038913c830500d6de51578307d8db62ad4c500edc87dd004", "ja": "みんな、ありがとう！　さっきの感じを\n忘れないように、チトセくんになってきますね！", "zh": "谢谢大家！为了不忘记刚才的感觉，\n我要去演千岁了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1055_p", "source_sha256": "46fb63a8dbb71d54aca67e1f6ec7267735e52bc8b79b764f224ecb199a717803", "ja": "（どうやら、上手くいきそうだな……よかった）", "zh": "（看来应该能顺利进行……太好了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_06_1056_p", "source_sha256": "5ce091fb262423642ebabb6865b61530e91124df6b54daca1dc8b77a7e511267", "ja": "（あのチトセは、きっと麗花なりに役に寄り添って\n生まれた姿……採用されるといいな）", "zh": "（那个千岁，一定是丽花以自己的方式贴近角色后诞生的模样……希望能被选用啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
